meta {
  name: Delete the cancellation
  type: http
  seq: 24
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/timetable-deviations/{{cancelledDeviationId}}
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  X-School-Id: {{schoolCode}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 204
}

docs {
  Deviations before slots, deliberately. Deleting a timetable cascades its
  slots away and takes every deviation attached to them with it, so running
  this after request 32 would answer 404 - not because the row was missing,
  but because it had already been removed by something else. The added class
  at request 27 is the exception: it hangs off no slot and survives, which is
  exactly why it has to be deleted by name.
}
